# Phase 130: satellites and rocket bodies on the sky map. Reads the
# elements in satellites.tle (copied into the sandbox), positions every
# one each second, and draws those above the horizon. The count line
# under the map says how many are up, how many can be seen, and how
# many NEOs the magnitude limit let through.
name    Satellite map: elements, positions, draw
timeout 120

expect 30  [SCENARIO] Satellite
expect 15  satellites and rocket bodies from
expect 5   sunlit against a dark sky
absent 3   [SATMAP] 0 satellites
wait   2
shot   satellite-map
